      "plan_contents": "# Pulse task #2712: Select tracks by clicking any unused track area\n\nOperation: db93bac5c43203bf8fd27a4c158b23b9\nAssignee: PORTALSURFER (Pulse #1, GitHub ID 41680373)\n\nUser native review, 17 October 2026: currently a track can only be selected by clicking its top section. Clicking unused background in the lower control section should also select the track. Allow selection by clicking any non-interactive area within the track UI, including unused space around automation, volume and record controls.\n\nAcceptance:\n- Unused background in both upper and lower sections selects the intended track.\n- Existing buttons, toggles, sliders and other active targets retain their own actions and gestures; background selection handling must not intercept or break them.\n- Preserve established selection modifiers, multi-selection and focus behavior. Verify event routing for unused areas versus real controls and native behavior in an optimized candidate.\n\nSeparate behavior follow-up from the track-outline/color-strip styling issue 2711. Planning capture only; do not replace the app while the user is testing.\n",
